  1. Can Antioxidants Protect Against Disuse Muscle Atrophy?
     Scott K. Powers
     PMC4213375 · PMC · 2014-10-30
     https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4213375/
     "This review examines the role of radicals in disuse muscle atrophy and analyzes literature on antioxidant effects. Evidence suggests specific antioxidants may help delay muscle loss due to inactivity."

